 "remarks": "Position your business for success in this well located and versatile office suite at 99 Prospect Street Unit 1B in the heart of downtown Stamford. Offering approximately 1,750 square feet of functional workspace, this ground level unit welcomes you with a professional reception area that sets the tone for clients and visitors alike. The layout features multiple private offices, open work areas, and flexible spaces that can easily adapt to a variety of professional uses. Large windows throughout bring in natural light, creating a bright and productive work environment while complementing the clean, classic interior finishes. A dedicated kitchenette and private restroom add convenience for daily operations, while the overall layout allows for both collaborative and private work settings. Situated within a well maintained brick building, this unit offers a strong presence in a highly desirable downtown location with exceptional walkability and easy access to local restaurants, shops, and public transportation. The HOA monthly fee includes heat and hot water, adding value and convenience to ownership. Whether you are expanding, relocating, or investing, this is a rare opportunity to secure a professional office space that blends functionality, location, and long term value in one of Stamford's most dynamic business districts.",
